              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaagira Abiasaari ati: Buri, obu Doegi Omunyaedomu yaabaire ariyo, nkamanyira kimwe ku arikwija kugambira Saulo. N'ahabw'ekyo ab'eka ya sho boona niinye bazizire. ",
          "type": "text",
